---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/paths";
import Seal from "../components/Seal.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Datafore is a growth and operations platform company based in Burnaby, BC, building for allied health clinics."
>
  <section class="border-b border-ink-200 bg-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-950 md:text-5xl">About Datafore</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
        Datafore started as a data and analytics consultancy, helping organizations get more value from the data
        they already had. That work — across data operations, governance, and cloud platforms — is what convinced
        us allied health needed a platform of its own: analytics, marketing technology, CRM enablement, and applied
        AI, built together rather than stitched from generic tools.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950">Why allied health</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
          Allied health clinics — physiotherapy, chiropractic, massage therapy, occupational therapy, and the
          disciplines around them — run on scheduling, billing, and marketing tools that were never designed
          around each other. That's a gap we've seen consistently, and it's one Datafore is built to close,
          starting close to home in British Columbia.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950">Where we're based</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
          Datafore Analytics Inc. is based in Burnaby, BC. We're building the platform in close collaboration with
          founding clinics across the province before expanding further.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-ink-200 bg-paper-dim">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
      <p class="credential-label text-seal-600">Team</p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-start gap-6 rounded-lg border border-ink-200 bg-white p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <img src={withBase("/images/sandeep-mehra.jpg")} alt="Sandeep Mehra" class="h-28 w-28 rounded-full object-cover" />
        <div class="flex-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-950">Sandeep Mehra</h3>
            <Seal size={26} class="text-seal-500">
              <path d="M42 36 L42 64 M42 36 C54 36 60 42 60 50 C60 58 54 64 42 64" />
            </Seal>
          </div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-seal-600">Product Manager, Analytics</p>
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/smehra2/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-ink-600 underline decoration-ink-300 underline-offset-4 hover:text-seal-600"
          >
            Connect on LinkedIn
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-ink-600">
        We're a small team today, and growing. If you want to help build a growth and operations platform for
        allied health in BC, we'd like to hear from you.
      </p>
      <a
        href={withBase("/contact/")}
        class="mt-6 inline-block rounded bg-ink-950 px-6 py-3 font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white transition-colors hover:bg-seal-700"
      >
        Get in touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
